---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run test
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load and parse profile and dataset inputs
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Validate profile executability
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Runnable evaluator summary

    alt Inputs are executable
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build validation payload
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Input or executability validation fails
        Vigilo-->>User: Validation error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
